# ✈️ Rocky Travel Agency

Welcome to **Rocky Travel Agency**! 🌍

This is a simple **Python-based Travel Booking System** developed using **Google Colab**. The project allows users to explore available holiday packages, select their desired destination, enter the number of tickets, and automatically calculate the total booking cost.

